@title Auto-wiring by pin kind: a motor below a coil is not wired to it
@area Schematic
@sizes 1366x768
# Audit defect C-11. A one-pole breaker may feed a coil (that wire is drawn),
# but the motor placed under the coil must not get a power wire to A2.
click_text "New project"
wait 20
key q
text mcb
key Return
click 600 150
wait 10
key q
text contactor
key Return
click 600 225
wait 10
shot coil-under-breaker
key q
text m3
key Return
click 600 300
wait 10
shot motor-under-coil
expect "Not wired"
